OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration over hazards caused by
OL,4,Aabandoned boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoat users say the danger posed by
OL,7,Fabandoned vessels on the River Hull is
OL,8,Fgetting worse.
OL,10,FThe issue has been a concern for years.
OL,11,FSome sunken boats were removed from the
OL,12,Friver in 2016, and the following year
OL,13,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said
OL,14,F10 others between Tickton and Beverley
OL,15,FBeck must be taken away, but many are
OL,16,Fstill abandoned.
OL,18,FLocal boat owner Lucy Welsh said: "It's
OL,19,Fhard to navigate because you have to be
OL,20,Fcareful you don't catch the hull on the
OL,21,Fbottom of anything. It could cause
OL,22,Fmajor damage."
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
