OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration over hazards caused by
OL,4,Aabandoned boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FIain Campbell, a trustee at the
OL,7,FBeverley Barge Preservation Society,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It's getting narrower and
OL,9,Fnarrower, and more and more difficult
OL,10,Fto safely take people on trips."
